<description>&lt;p&gt;UNMISS has rapidly deployed patrols to Tonj North after intercommunal violence and Tonj East has begun peace talks to end the fighting. A plane crash killed 14 people, while water shortages and garbage accumulation in Juba have prompted municipal clean-up efforts. Kiir reshuffled the Jonglei state government and overhauled the South Sudan Revenue Authority Board. Uganda defended its military deployment in South Sudan and the government set conditions for Dr. Riek Machar’s return to Juba. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQZTBiTHNTMC1HZXR4VmRobC1SaVhWeE1aTk0ydEwtTEtJRXhrNmstdWpJWVBQcy1Lall4UUlpbWkxSE5kSkZtdWFhV1NhdUpEdDJuYkE1VXRDZGVPV3dpbGZNV3kwc21vOTR2S0pxczZRcXJ0TFJiRWk4U0JHUWxwMmc5ejdaVzVXYkZ4c0tKSGNJR25GOFZqZA?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNMHVRRE42XzIxN0dBQmNibmZtUGdXY2JIUVFUVlJKMkZzLU44N1Ruem5wUVg4UkJLSzBKbDZEUjFhQzZBUlZ4R1NaSjRVY0k0bl9TckNTVU5NalFFVUNZSjZPLVp1VWdIalAwcDN6OGRpb3hkUlpIWHdPZ3ktLVF3Q1psQ3huUk1ySXlwUmlxeHU3NUV0ejY1SmZ3MA?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewVision.co.ug&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQZEVtdGNReTFodzlycGNnLW5hSVh3SUdWMlJ0RUlhQ0hGdUR2U2NuUTZyanA1aVlhY1RDX0RkSzB4ZjY0dlR1elJXWGZGZ0lrWEszVGNNTjMydklVZkRSUHprZFBlM1dPYkRSMENhNGtrR0JwSnZvRmlCQVNWUWY2dUZWeTlqaUlsRGhvZzhEOEwySW1aSlFWNFZCcGRBNEtURUtPMi1ZY0RQU2hT